# Outputs

This directory contains the exported experimental results and evaluation visualizations generated by the machine learning workflow.

Contents include:
- Model performance comparison tables.
- Confusion matrices.
- ROC and Precision-Recall curves.
- Threshold analysis plots.
- Feature importance visualizations.

**Note:** The trained Random Forest model (`random_forest.joblib`) is not included in this directory or the GitHub repository because its file size exceeds GitHub's upload limit. It is stored separately on Google Drive.

Most outputs can be regenerated by running the end-to-end notebook in the `notebooks/` directory.
